WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.560
In 2024, London's GDP per
head was 72,201 pounds.

2
00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:12.150
In the North East of England,
it was 29,957 pounds.

3
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.950
London's figure is 2.4 times as high.

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.050
The 2021 census counted 8,799,727
people in Greater London.

5
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:27.730
It is a top-ranked world
city, alongside New York.

6
00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:29.410
So London is rich.

7
00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:32.870
But is it also the best
place in Britain to live?

8
00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:35.650
In this mission, you'll
test London on housing,

9
00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:40.070
air, water, waste and
regeneration, not just money.

10
00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:43.730
Then you'll hear what residents
say, and compare London with Dhaka,

11
00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:45.790
a fast-growing megacity.

12
00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:50.680
Your mission: decide whether London is
also the best place in Britain to live.
